        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Our Origin",
            "heading": "A modern approach to an ancient craft.",
            "text": "<p>GemLux Jewel began with a simple search for an engagement ring — and the realisation that the industry could be gentler, clearer, and far more considered.</p><p>What started as one custom ring became the catalyst for a different kind of jewellery experience: one shaped by conscience, craftsmanship and care.</p><p>We have crafted a name for ourselves by creating lab-grown diamond, moissanite and gemstone pieces designed for a lifetime — chosen by clients who expect beauty and integrity in equal measure.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsAppImage2026-08-11at12.18.35PM.jpg",
            "image_position": "right"
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Where We Are Today",
            "heading": "Trusted by couples around the world.",
            "text": "<p>GemLux Jewel has grown into a premium jewellery brand trusted by thousands of couples worldwide. We create distinctive engagement rings, wedding bands and fine jewellery — crafted for longevity, with beauty and conscience at the heart of every decision.</p><p>With showrooms and personalised virtual appointments available anywhere, we serve a global community — helping people mark the stories and moments that matter most with pieces designed to last.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsAppImage2026-08-11at12.18.35PM_1.jpg",
            "image_position": "left"
          }
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Our Promise",
            "heading": "Unreasonable care in every detail.",
            "text": "<p>Our promise shows up in the smallest details. It's in the way a showroom is considered and laid out. It's in how a ring is engineered to wear beautifully for decades. And it's in how we remember a client's story and respond with genuine attention.</p><p>This commitment shapes everything we do — design, service, production, aftercare — and it's what makes the GemLux Jewel experience distinct, consistent and deeply human.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsAppImage2026-08-11at12.18.36PM.jpg",
            "image_position": "right"
          }
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Our Mission",
            "heading": "Beautiful jewellery made with conscience. Lasting experiences wrapped in care.",
            "text": "<p>From ethically sourced materials to considered design and personalised guidance, every detail reflects a belief that how something is made — and how it's experienced — matters just as much as how it looks.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/wave-feather-contour-wedding-band-detail.png",
            "image_position": "left"
          }
        },
        "row_5": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Our Purpose",
            "heading": "To craft amazing moments in people's lives.",
            "text": "<p>Each piece marks a moment to remember. GemLux Jewel exists to honour life's milestones with heirlooms in the making, designed to be worn often, loved deeply, and carried forward through time.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/marquise-cut-lab-grown-diamond-leaf-vine-engagement-ring-3ct-front.jpg",
            "image_position": "right"
